<h3 class="mt-4">YARP Auth settings:</h3>
<h4 class="mt-2">Blazor Consumer - needed to remove "AuthorizationPolicy": "anonymous" from Yarp Products route as will always cause to omit token. </h4>
<p class="text-danger">    --- Setting Route "AuthorizationPolicy": "anonymous" causes downstream api for Claims to fail as the token is omitted for the products api.</p>
<p class="text-danger">    --- Removing "AuthorizationPolicy": "anonymous" allows both authenticated and anonymous access to the API alone with the API determining access or not.</p>
<h4 class="mt-2">For API routes other than Products, i.e. those always requiring auth, could set an auth policy to enforce at YARP vs at the API. </h4>
<p class="text-danger">    --- Currently no auth policies are set for YARP routes.</p>

